# Supabase Edge Functions live here.
#
# Empty until Phase 2. Architecture.md reserves this directory for the few things
# that genuinely need server-side execution — prescription/invoice PDF generation,
# the WhatsApp webhook, and complex billing calculation — not as a general API
# layer. Phase 1 tenancy logic is plain Postgres functions called via
